1
00:00:06,417 --> 00:00:09,087
(Sheldon:)Just out of curiosity, Penny,

2
00:00:09,087 --> 00:00:12,317
(Sheldon:)if this experiment does
make us fall in love,

3
00:00:12,323 --> 00:00:15,563
(Sheldon:)would you drive me
to Lake Geneva, Wisconsin

4
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,390
(Sheldon:)for Gary Con?

5
00:00:18,396 --> 00:00:20,196
(Sheldon:)It's the only convention
celebrating

6
00:00:20,198 --> 00:00:22,668
(Sheldon:)the life and work of Gary Gygax,

7
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:25,767
(Sheldon:)the co-creator
of Dungeons and Dragons.

8
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:27,500
(Penny:)You know what?

9
00:00:27,505 --> 00:00:29,275
(Penny:)I can honestly say
if we fall in love,

10
00:00:29,274 --> 00:00:31,274
(Penny:)not only will I drive you there,
I will buy you

11
00:00:31,276 --> 00:00:33,346
(Penny:)all the dragon T-shirts
you want.

12
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,510
(Sheldon:)Okay, babe, let's do this.

13
00:00:40,552 --> 00:00:42,822
(Raj:)You guys are
really being calm

14
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,020
(Raj:)about Penny and Sheldon
doing this thing.

15
00:00:45,023 --> 00:00:46,053
(stammers)
If it were me,

16
00:00:46,057 --> 00:00:47,527
I-I'd be a little nervous.

17
00:00:47,525 --> 00:00:48,555
(Amy:)Why?
Well,

18
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,830
(Raj:)even if the study's nonsense,

19
00:00:49,827 --> 00:00:52,427
I-I don't believe
in tempting fate.

20
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:54,530
(Raj:)Same reason I wouldn't
use a Ouija board,

21
00:00:54,532 --> 00:00:57,102
(Raj:)or pick a fight
with an Asian guy.

22
00:00:57,101 --> 00:01:00,171
(Raj:)He probably doesn't know karate,
but... why risk it?

23
00:01:00,171 --> 00:01:02,501
(Amy:)I think we're safe.

